  "collectionBlockers": [
    {"id":"VIS-001","severity":"release-blocking","title":"Reference-faithful geometry remains unproven","finding":"The fleet has varied primitives but still reads as a repeated simplified slab-hull/superstructure vocabulary; all 20 draft distinctive-features checks fail.","requiredAction":"Refine hulls, glazing, rooflines, decks and model-specific features against each reference dossier, then re-review canonical views."},
    {"id":"VIS-002","severity":"release-blocking","title":"Interior proportionality and cutaway framing remain inconsistent","finding":"Room-specific proportional sizing is visibly improved, and the latest cameras are backed out relative to the prior closeups. However, several review renders still present narrow diagonal slits or large opaque side-wall/roof slabs across the room, while other views expose only shallow furniture/partition assemblies. Both-side-wall cutaway handling is therefore not consistently readable, and all 20 room sets remain blockout-level.","requiredAction":"Tune room-specific scale and camera distance per yacht; make both-side-wall cutaway visibility consistent without opaque occlusion; resolve shells, joinery, fixtures and physical supports before repeating the furnished-room, intersection, seam and camera checks."},
    {"id":"VIS-003","severity":"release-blocking","title":"Material payloads remain visually insufficient","finding":"All 84 GLBs contain authored 128x128 texture/image payloads, but the current renders still read largely as flat color-block treatments. The synchronized draft records fail textures and materials-in-all-views for all 20.","requiredAction":"Apply model-appropriate, sufficiently resolved materials and demonstrate consistent legibility across every canonical exterior, room, deck and exploded view."},
    {"id":"APP-001","severity":"release-blocking","title":"No independent approval exists","finding":"All 20 quality records remain changes-required with reviewer independent-qa-pending. Technical visual reviews are pending, publicationReady is false for all 20, metrics self-review is not QA-approved for all 20, and the same nine draft fail checks remain on every record even where camera, luminance and LOD evidence improved.","requiredAction":"After the visual blockers are fixed, run a new independent QA pass and record explicit approval per selected ID."}
  ],
